WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:31.375
So far, in this chapter,

2
00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:32.750
Lord Krishna has explained

3
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.333
about the method of yoga,

4
00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:39.458
and explained that any effort made toward yoga

5
00:00:39.458 --> 00:00:41.625
doesn't go to waste.

6
00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:45.083
Lord Krishna explained how a yogi,

7
00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:47.916
after the journey of many births, ultimately

8
00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:49.916
attains perfection

9
00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:53.333
and attains Paramātmā.

10
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:56.375
Now here, Lord Krishna is comparing yoga

11
00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:59.583
with other spiritual practices.

12
00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:07.500
In this verse, Lord Krishna says

13
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.875
that a yogi is superior to any ascetic, scholar,

14
00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:14.875
and karma yogi. And for this very reason,

15
00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:16.416
he is also directing Arjuna

16
00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:19.166
to become a yogi.

17
00:01:19.166 --> 00:01:20.041
This is a very

18
00:01:20.041 --> 00:01:23.750
big endorsement of yoga by Lord Krishna.

19
00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.666
An ascetic makes spiritual
 progress through severe penance,

20
00:01:26.666 --> 00:01:27.541
and a scholar

21
00:01:27.541 --> 00:01:29.083
through knowledge.

22
00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:31.666
He makes his spiritual progress.

23
00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:33.541
On the other hand, a karma yogi

24
00:01:33.541 --> 00:01:35.708
does karma with the desire for fruit.

25
00:01:35.708 --> 00:01:39.666
Lord Krishna is calling yoga superior to all these.

26
00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:41.041
But here we must

27
00:01:41.041 --> 00:01:43.458
remember once again

28
00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:47.666
that the meaning of yoga here is not
 just some physical activities

29
00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:50.208
or some moments of meditation.

30
00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:52.250
Here the meaning of yoga is

31
00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:56.208
connecting one's consciousness
 with Paramātmā.

32
00:01:56.208 --> 00:01:57.166
It's not

33
00:01:57.166 --> 00:01:59.958
that other practices aren't beneficial.

34
00:01:59.958 --> 00:02:02.916
But yes! Compared to yoga, in all of them

35
00:02:02.916 --> 00:02:05.750
something or other is left out.

36
00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:08.541
An ascetic – definitely follows strict observance

37
00:02:08.541 --> 00:02:11.541
of renunciation, rules, and discipline,

38
00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:13.583
from this their purification happens,

39
00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:17.791
but having deep knowledge
 of soul and Paramātmā

40
00:02:17.791 --> 00:02:19.583
is not necessary.

41
00:02:19.583 --> 00:02:23.541
On the other hand – a scholar does
 obtain knowledge of soul and Paramātmā.

42
00:02:23.541 --> 00:02:27.291
But this knowledge obtained from scriptures

43
00:02:27.291 --> 00:02:30.416
often remains limited only to intellect.

44
00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:33.500
And if this isn't fully practiced in life,

45
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:37.166
then true experience of
 Paramātmā won't happen.

46
00:02:37.166 --> 00:02:40.375
On the other hand, 
a karma yogi does good deeds,

47
00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:41.458
but often

48
00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:44.000
behind this there's expectation of fruit,

49
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.375
not spiritual perspective.

50
00:02:46.375 --> 00:02:49.416
But a yogi is above all these,

51
00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:51.541
because through yoga

52
00:02:51.541 --> 00:02:52.666
they connect themselves,

53
00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:55.791
meaning the soul, with Paramātmā,

54
00:02:55.791 --> 00:02:58.583
can directly realize him.

55
00:02:58.583 --> 00:03:02.791
The destination of this journey itself
 is to attain Paramātmā.

56
00:03:02.791 --> 00:03:07.250
And this is the supreme purpose of spirituality.

57
00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:10.375
And yes! Remember the context!

58
00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:11.666
Here Lord Krishna

59
00:03:11.666 --> 00:03:14.458
is endorsing only that yoga

60
00:03:14.458 --> 00:03:17.458
which is done with the purpose of connecting

61
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:21.375
a person to the soul, and
 ultimately to Paramātmā.

62
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:30.208
Arjuna is a warrior,

63
00:03:30.208 --> 00:03:33.125
he has many responsibilities,

64
00:03:33.125 --> 00:03:38.458
but still can become a yogi.

65
00:03:38.458 --> 00:03:41.291
Becoming a yogi doesn't mean

66
00:03:41.291 --> 00:03:42.083
that a person

67
00:03:42.083 --> 00:03:46.125
goes very far from worldly environment

68
00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:52.625
and going into solitude
 starts doing some rare rituals.

69
00:03:52.625 --> 00:03:54.208
Becoming a yogi

70
00:03:54.208 --> 00:03:58.250
is adopting the mentality of yoga.

71
00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:01.666
You too can become a yogi,

72
00:04:01.666 --> 00:04:05.458
whatever you may be in personal life –

73
00:04:05.458 --> 00:04:08.291
a student, a businessperson,

74
00:04:08.291 --> 00:04:11.625
a householder, or anyone else.

75
00:04:11.625 --> 00:04:15.916
The basic perspective of yoga is this –

76
00:04:15.916 --> 00:04:19.041
that whatever work you do,

77
00:04:19.041 --> 00:04:20.916
remain aware of Paramātmā

78
00:04:20.916 --> 00:04:25.333
and your relationship.

79
00:04:25.333 --> 00:04:27.916
When you engage in any work

80
00:04:27.916 --> 00:04:32.291
with full consciousness and
 consider every activity

81
00:04:32.291 --> 00:04:33.833
and opportunity

82
00:04:33.833 --> 00:04:37.958
as an opportunity to connect with Paramātmā,

83
00:04:37.958 --> 00:04:42.166
then you are following yoga.

84
00:04:42.166 --> 00:04:44.166
For example,

85
00:04:44.166 --> 00:04:49.166
you cook food for someone
 with such a spirit of service

86
00:04:49.166 --> 00:04:53.583
as if you are serving that
 food to Paramātmā Himself.

87
00:04:53.583 --> 00:04:54.500
Or

88
00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:56.250
you help someone

89
00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:59.666
with this perspective as if

90
00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:03.125
you're grateful for this opportunity of service,

91
00:05:03.125 --> 00:05:07.500
because your every service
 is service to Paramātmā.

92
00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:08.625
This perspective

93
00:05:08.625 --> 00:05:12.583
connects every deed of yours to Paramātmā.

94
00:05:12.583 --> 00:05:17.125
And this is what makes you a yogi.

95
00:05:17.125 --> 00:05:20.291
Whatever responsibility you're fulfilling,

96
00:05:20.291 --> 00:05:24.625
whatever problem you're solving, you can

97
00:05:24.625 --> 00:05:28.375
adopt this perspective of yoga in every work.

98
00:05:28.375 --> 00:05:33.666
Yoga is such a practice of living life –

99
00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:37.083
in which you start seeing
 the presence of Paramātmā

100
00:05:37.083 --> 00:05:38.333
in every person, every circumstance,

101
00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:41.708
every moment.

102
00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:44.666
Do every work with that truth

103
00:05:44.666 --> 00:05:49.291
as if it's direct service to Paramātmā.

104
00:05:53.833 --> 00:05:57.083
In society today, regarding yoga,

105
00:05:57.083 --> 00:06:00.250
there's this big concept

106
00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.541
that yoga is only a means

107
00:06:03.541 --> 00:06:07.875
to improve physical and mental health.

108
00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:10.583
Many people call physical postures

109
00:06:10.583 --> 00:06:15.166
and breathing processes yoga.

110
00:06:15.166 --> 00:06:19.916
But the Gita teaches you this –

111
00:06:19.916 --> 00:06:21.875
that true yoga

112
00:06:21.875 --> 00:06:25.500
is not just some daily activity,

113
00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:30.000
but a perspective of living life.

114
00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.541
And this perspective

115
00:06:32.541 --> 00:06:36.625
can be adopted in every moment of life.

116
00:06:36.625 --> 00:06:40.541
The perspective of yoga says that with true

117
00:06:40.541 --> 00:06:43.708
heart, every moment, every responsibility,

118
00:06:43.708 --> 00:06:48.125
every activity, remain connected 
with Paramātmā.

119
00:06:48.125 --> 00:06:52.166
But how can this perspective be adopted

120
00:06:52.166 --> 00:06:55.416
in modern society today?

121
00:06:55.416 --> 00:06:56.875
By considering every responsibility

122
00:06:56.875 --> 00:07:00.916
as an opportunity given by Paramātmā.

123
00:07:00.916 --> 00:07:04.666
For example – a student –

124
00:07:04.666 --> 00:07:08.000
if they adopt this perspective that acquiring

125
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:11.541
knowledge is work given by Paramātmā,

126
00:07:11.541 --> 00:07:13.708
so that being educated

127
00:07:13.708 --> 00:07:16.625
they can help other people.

128
00:07:16.625 --> 00:07:17.958
A teacher –

129
00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:21.833
sees future possibility in every student,

130
00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:24.875
gives them education with this perspective

131
00:07:24.875 --> 00:07:28.958
as if all are parts of Paramātmā,

132
00:07:28.958 --> 00:07:30.500
as if for this very reason

133
00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:34.375
Paramātmā made them a teacher.

134
00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:38.541
A politician – if they use their position

135
00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:42.500
for public welfare. Instead of showing arrogance,

136
00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:46.500
remain truly grateful toward the public.

137
00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:49.583
Whenever you fulfill your responsibility

138
00:07:49.583 --> 00:07:53.875
with true heart as service to Paramātmā,

139
00:07:53.875 --> 00:07:58.250
you do every work humbly and gratefully,

140
00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:02.666
then you adopt the perspective of yoga.

141
00:08:02.666 --> 00:08:06.416
In such a case, you become a yogi,

142
00:08:06.416 --> 00:08:11.625
and your entire life itself becomes a practice.

143
00:08:16.166 --> 00:08:16.875
Nowadays

144
00:08:16.875 --> 00:08:20.250
there's a lot of stress in professional life.

145
00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:22.458
In such a case, many organizations,

146
00:08:22.458 --> 00:08:25.791
to keep the mind calm, increase concentration,

147
00:08:25.791 --> 00:08:28.333
or improve health,

148
00:08:28.333 --> 00:08:33.375
inspire their employees toward yoga.

149
00:08:33.375 --> 00:08:37.791
But all this is just some physical postures,

150
00:08:37.791 --> 00:08:42.000
some activities related to breathing.

151
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.041
True yoga

152
00:08:44.041 --> 00:08:47.166
is far more excellent than this.

153
00:08:47.166 --> 00:08:48.541
True yoga

154
00:08:48.541 --> 00:08:51.750
is not limited only to improving physical health

155
00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:55.833
or controlling stress.

156
00:08:55.833 --> 00:09:00.291
True yoga is connecting with Paramātmā,

157
00:09:00.291 --> 00:09:05.125
doing every work surrendered to Him.

158
00:09:05.125 --> 00:09:06.625
In professional life too,

159
00:09:06.625 --> 00:09:08.916
you can adopt this perspective of true

160
00:09:08.916 --> 00:09:13.041
yoga in many ways.

161
00:09:13.041 --> 00:09:15.625
Seeing the purpose of

162
00:09:15.625 --> 00:09:18.500
human welfare behind your
 professional responsibility.

163
00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:23.000
Not doing any work that harms someone else.

164
00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.166
not for selfishness or fruit.

165
00:09:26.166 --> 00:09:30.000
Doing some work understanding it as service,

166
00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.291
When you fulfill your responsibilities

167
00:09:32.291 --> 00:09:34.250
with this perspective,

168
00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:36.708
then every problem becomes an opportunity

169
00:09:36.708 --> 00:09:39.125
for spiritual progress,

170
00:09:39.125 --> 00:09:40.791
every activity

171
00:09:40.791 --> 00:09:45.333
becomes an opportunity for
 service to Paramātmā.

172
00:09:45.333 --> 00:09:47.416
This is definitely certain

173
00:09:47.416 --> 00:09:51.375
that with this mentality, stress in you will reduce

174
00:09:51.375 --> 00:09:54.416
and self-satisfaction will increase.

175
00:09:54.416 --> 00:09:55.833
When a person

176
00:09:55.833 --> 00:09:59.750
develops this mentality of yoga,

177
00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.458
then patience is experienced in

178
00:10:01.458 --> 00:10:03.833
difficult circumstances,

179
00:10:03.833 --> 00:10:06.625
concentration comes in every work,

180
00:10:06.625 --> 00:10:12.625
the mind remains calm in
 every result, good or bad.
